The package.xml files for the Curiosity Rover and Canadarm demos indicates the
license as GPL. However, this is not a valid SPDX identifier. It may refer to
the General Public License, but it does not specify which version. Moreover
the Space ROS Demos are intended to be under Apache 2.0.

See the pull request for details:
https://github.com/space-ros/demos/commit/df7874dcacd3c25d6adede14291d59abbd86fae6

See this discussion for a list of affected packages;
https://github.com/space-ros/space-ros/discussions/326 
